      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add extra information, it seems that teleportation is being tied to framerate.\n\nTo reproduce this bug\n\n- Go to the World \"Terrors of Nowhere\"\n\n- For a control run, make sure your framerate is above 60 fps (the bug will not occur)\n\n- Limit your framerate to Under 50 fps (30 is a good number)\n\n- Start a round\n\n- The bug will occur after being killed by the terror. In this case you will not teleport out of the map correctly\n\nTo be further clear, this bug only happens on the Open Beta version of VRChat",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
